---
description: graphify knowledge graph context (product codebase)
alwaysApply: true
---

This project has a graphify knowledge graph at `graphify-out/` (local; gitignored).

Before broad codebase exploration, run:
- `graphify query "<question>"`
- `graphify path "<symbolA>" "<symbolB>"`

`graphify-out/` is not committed. After code edits: `graphify update .` from repo root.

Maintainer-only docs (HANDOVER, study guide) live in `briefr-maintainer`, not this repo.
